# Pairs with LinkGateMatchesLinking. A link gate released before the link returns admits a second link onto the parents.
MODULE: AbsorbReleasesLinkGate
TARGET: LinkGateMatchesLinking
CLASS: Invariant
SUMMARY: the root releases its link gate as the grandparent absorbs the division
PERTURBS: GrandparentAbsorbs

--- FIND
    /\ ch[o] = "grand"
    /\ ch' = [ch EXCEPT ![o] = "return"]
    /\ UNCHANGED <<fg, cap, cons, gate, sib, lg, seed, overflowed, cascaded, linked, dep, deacts>>
--- REPLACE
    /\ ch[o] = "grand"
    /\ ch' = [ch EXCEPT ![o] = "return"]
    \* MUTATION: the link gate is released early
    /\ lg' = "none"
    /\ UNCHANGED <<fg, cap, cons, gate, sib, seed, overflowed, cascaded, linked, dep, deacts>>
--- END
